{"seq":3,"slug":"endpoint-health-adaptive","title":"按接收端点健康自适应退避","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/global-delivery-ops/endpoint-health-adaptive","wordCount":2317,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"按接收端点健康自适应退避\">按接收端点健康自适应退避</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>投递池是一份共享资源：worker、连接槽位、出站带宽、重试预算。当少数接收端点持续不健康（长时间超时、连续 5xx、域名解析失败）时，如果投递引擎照常给它们投放资源，这些坏端点会占用大量 worker 与连接槽位——它们的投递要等到超时才释放资源，而健康端点的投递几毫秒就完成了。结果是<strong>少数坏端点拖慢了绝大多数好端点的投递延迟</strong>，这就是投递池版本的 noisy neighbor 问题。</p>\n<p><strong>端点健康自适应</strong>的核心是：把每个接收端点看作一个需要被评估的对象，用一个健康评分驱动三个量——该端点的<strong>并发上限</strong>、<strong>退避基数</strong>、以及<strong>是否进入熔断</strong>。健康端点的投递资源放开，病态端点的资源收紧，让投递池的总吞吐最大化。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"../webhook-delivery-queue/retry-backoff-jitter\">1.2 指数退避重试与抖动</a>是同一个问题的两个尺度：1.2 讲的是「单条投递任务」的退避曲线，本篇讲的是「一个端点」的整体调度策略。两者叠加使用——端点健康决定退避的基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，单条任务的失败次数决定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的指数位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[投递结果流] --&gt; B[端点健康评分器&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口成功率 + 延迟]&#10;    B --&gt; C{健康分区间}&#10;    C --&gt;|健康 90-100| D[并发放开&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 5s]&#10;    C --&gt;|次健康 60-90| E[并发降半&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 30s]&#10;    C --&gt;|病态 20-60| F[并发降为 1&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 10min]&#10;    C --&gt;|熔断 0-20| G[暂停常规投递&lt;br/&gt;探针投递探活]&#10;    G --&gt;|探针成功| H[逐步恢复&lt;br/&gt;加性提升并发]&#10;    H --&gt; C&#10;    D --&gt; I[投递执行]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[投递结果流] --&gt; B[端点健康评分器&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口成功率 + 延迟]\n    B --&gt; C{健康分区间}\n    C --&gt;|健康 90-100| D[并发放开&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 5s]\n    C --&gt;|次健康 60-90| E[并发降半&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 30s]\n    C --&gt;|病态 20-60| F[并发降为 1&lt;br/&gt;退避基数 10min]\n    C --&gt;|熔断 0-20| G[暂停常规投递&lt;br/&gt;探针投递探活]\n    G --&gt;|探针成功| H[逐步恢复&lt;br/&gt;加性提升并发]\n    H --&gt; C\n    D --&gt; I[投递执行]\n    E --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"健康评分怎么算\">健康评分怎么算</h2><p>评分必须是<strong>可解释</strong>的，否则运营无法信任它在故障时的决策。两个输入足够覆盖绝大多数场景：</p>\n<p><strong>滑动窗口成功率</strong>：取最近 N 次投递（如 50 次）或最近 T 分钟（如 5 分钟）的成功比例。用滑动窗口而非累计值，是为了让评分能跟随端点的近期状态变化——一个昨天全坏、今天全好的端点，评分应当快速回升。窗口大小的权衡：窗口太小会被单次抖动带偏，窗口太大则响应迟钝。实践中用双窗口——短窗（1 分钟）用于快速反应，长窗（15 分钟）用于稳定判定，取两者加权。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟分位数</strong>：取窗口内投递延迟的 p95。延迟上升往往是端点过载的<strong>领先信号</strong>——端点还没开始返回 5xx，但已经开始变慢。用它做预警能把熔断提前，减少无谓的失败尝试。但延迟对跨区域端点天然更高，所以评分时要按区域分别归一化（与 <a href=\"multi-region-delivery\">4.1 就近投递区域/出口</a>的路由目标区域一致），不能用全球统一基线。</p>\n<p>一个实用的加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>short</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>long</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mn>95</mn><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h = 100 \\cdot \\left( w_s \\cdot s_{\\text{short}} + (1-w_s) \\cdot s_{\\text{long}} \\right) \\cdot \\left( 1 - w_l \\cdot \\min\\left(1, \\frac{p95}{p95_{\\text{baseline}}}\\right) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">short</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">long</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是成功率（0–1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><msub><mn>95</mn><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95_{\\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该端点对的历史基线延迟。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重（如 0.6 与 0.3）。这个形式让成功率的权重高于延迟，同时让延迟异常能在成功率还没崩之前压低保分。</p>\n<p><strong>必须处理的边界情况</strong>：新端点（无历史数据）应当以中性分启动并从样本快速学习；长期无投递的端点（如低频事件类型）不能让陈旧评分决定现状，评分应随时间衰减回中性值；单次投递的端点（只投过一条）不能因为它成功了就评满分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断与-保留最终投递尝试\">熔断与「保留最终投递尝试」</h2><p>当健康分跌破熔断阈值，端点进入熔断状态：暂停常规投递，不再对它做正常调度的重试。这一步直接解决 noisy neighbor——坏端点不再占用投递池资源，好端点的延迟恢复。</p>\n<p>但熔断必须有一个关键约束：<strong>熔断是为了保护投递池，不是为了永久放弃这个接收方</strong>。所以熔断状态下的端点仍应以<strong>极低频率</strong>接受探针投递：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>探针频率</strong>从低频起步（如每 5 分钟一条），成功后按指数增加频率（5min → 2min → 30s → 恢复正常）。</li>\n<li><strong>探针选择真实事件</strong>，而不是合成请求。合成请求能验证「能连上」，但真实事件的载荷更大、签名更完整，能验证完整的投递路径；且如果探针成功了，这条真实事件也就送达了，没有浪费。</li>\n<li><strong>探针成功即逐步恢复</strong>，且恢复是<strong>加性提升</strong>（additive increase）——并发从 1 加到 2、4、8，而不是一次性恢复到满额。乘性降低 + 加性提升（类似 TCP 拥塞控制）能在恢复期避免对刚痊愈的端点造成二次冲击。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>熔断有一个必须明说的风险</strong>：熔断期间产生的事件不会立刻投递，它们会进入队列等待。若不设上限，一个长期熔断的端点会积累海量待投递事件。所以熔断期的任务要有明确归宿：要么计入正常重试预算（由 <a href=\"../dead-letter-replay/dlq-webhook\">3.1 死信队列与人工处理</a>在预算耗尽后收进死信），要么进入一个「端点暂停队列」，在端点恢复后按受限速率回放。<strong>绝不能因为熔断而让事件静默消失</strong>——那是丢数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退避基数的端点级缩放\">退避基数的端点级缩放</h2><p>端点健康分直接缩放 <a href=\"../webhook-delivery-queue/retry-backoff-jitter\">1.2 指数退避重试与抖动</a>里的退避基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>健康分</th>\n<th>退避基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>并发上限</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>90–100</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>满额（如 64）</td>\n<td>健康端点值得快速重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70–90</td>\n<td>20s</td>\n<td>半额</td>\n<td>偶发问题，适度放慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40–70</td>\n<td>2min</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>明显不稳，大幅放慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–40</td>\n<td>20min</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>高度病态，仅保留探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0–10</td>\n<td>60min（探针频率）</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>熔断，只走探针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个表的价值在于它让「为什么这个端点的重试这么慢」有了明确答案：因为它的健康分是 45。运营在看板上看到健康分，就能解释投递延迟，而不必猜测。<strong>健康分与退避决策必须都暴露在运营界面上</strong>，否则这套机制会变成一个「黑箱在偷偷降速」，引发「为什么我的 webhook 变慢了」的困惑。</p>\n<p>并发上限的收紧要配合<strong>在途请求的排空</strong>：当端点从健康降到病态，已经在途的请求不能立即取消（取消会产生更多不确定状态），应允许它们自然结束，只是不再投放新请求。所以并发收紧是「停止新增」而非「强制中止」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与全局限流-接收方限流的协同\">与全局限流、接收方限流的协同</h2><p>端点健康不是唯一的限流信号，三者必须协同，且优先级明确。</p>\n<p><strong>接收方主动限流（429）优先级最高</strong>。当端点返回 429，无论健康分多高，都必须尊重它——读取 <code>Retry-After</code> 并据此退避，同时立即下调该端点的并发上限（429 是对端在明确说「你发太快了」）。健康分应当把 429 计入失败，但不能把它与 5xx 等同——429 说明端点健康、只是要求降速，所以对 429 的正确响应是降并发而非降健康分的成功率分量。</p>\n<p><strong>平台级全局限流是兜底</strong>。当投递池整体接近饱和（worker 用尽、连接池打满），全局限流应当按「业务权重 × 端点健康」决定谁先被降级——把资源优先留给健康端点的关键事件（如 <code>payment.*</code>），而不是均匀地降所有人的速。</p>\n<p><strong>单端点的合规上限是硬约束</strong>。某些接收方在合同里约定了最大投递速率（如「每秒不超过 100 条」），这个上限必须由平台配置强制生效，不受健康分影响（健康分只降不升）。这三者的关系是：合同上限是天花板、健康分是动态调节器、全局限流是最后的兜底闸门。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>对并发的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>429 / <code>Retry-After</code></td>\n<td>接收方实时</td>\n<td>单端点</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>立即下调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同速率上限</td>\n<td>平台配置</td>\n<td>单端点</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>硬上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端点健康分</td>\n<td>平台测算</td>\n<td>单端点</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>动态缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局池饱和</td>\n<td>平台自身</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>按权重降级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>少数持续不健康的端点会通过长时间占用 worker 与连接槽位拖慢整体投递延迟，这是投递池版本的 noisy neighbor。</li>\n<li>健康评分用双窗口成功率加归一化延迟分位数，必须可解释且暴露在运营界面，否则会被当成黑箱降速。</li>\n<li>熔断暂停常规投递以保护投递池，但必须保留低频的真实事件探针投递；探针用真实事件，成功后加性恢复并发。</li>\n<li>熔断期事件不能静默消失：要么计入正常重试预算进死信，要么进端点暂停队列待恢复后回放。</li>\n<li>健康分直接缩放退避基数与并发上限；并发收紧是「停止新增」而非「取消在途」。</li>\n<li>四类限流信号优先级明确：接收方 429 最高、合同上限是硬天花板、健康分是动态调节器、全局池饱和是兜底闸门。</li>\n<li>429 表示对端要求降速而非端点不健康，应对是降并发而非同 5xx 一样降低成功率分量。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按接收端点健康自适应退避","id":"按接收端点健康自适应退避"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"健康评分怎么算","id":"健康评分怎么算"},{"level":2,"text":"熔断与「保留最终投递尝试」","id":"熔断与-保留最终投递尝试"},{"level":2,"text":"退避基数的端点级缩放","id":"退避基数的端点级缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"与全局限流、接收方限流的协同","id":"与全局限流-接收方限流的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"送达率/延迟/失败监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/global-delivery-ops/delivery-rate-monitor"},"next":null}